{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284130","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028413001:1":{"text":"어때요? 당신도 온몸에 힘이 없나요?","source_cn":"你感觉怎么样，也是全身乏力吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC4E119A837FB249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028413002:1":{"text":"이것 좀 보세요. 원래 제가 채집대에서 가장 건장했는데, 지금은 걷는 것도 힘들어요.","source_cn":"你瞧瞧，以前我是队伍里最壮的！现在可好，连走路都累。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630F770BACA27683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028413003:1":{"text":"휴, 이건 대체 무슨 병일까요? 미샤르테시여, 제발 어서 낫게 해주세요.","source_cn":"唉，这到底是什么病啊。弥萨忒在上，赶紧让我好起来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13160F6B772B9319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028413004:1":{"text":"음, 온몸이 나른하고, 혈관은 파래지고... 부패 잠식 증상이 분명해요. ","source_cn":"嗯，全身乏力，血管发青……确实是一样的腐化侵蚀症状。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7472577C74F6574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:采集队员沃尔森":{"text":"채집대원 월슨","source":"采集队员沃尔森","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}